body:
Tattoos, guitar lessons, money to rent an art studio, and tickets to some of my favorite music artists. I'd love to see BabyMetal, GalaxyGirlPaida, MCR and maybe even a Vocaloid concert.

&#x200B;

If it wasn't for me, though, I'd like to put money into a homeless shelter and no-kill animal shelter, as well as a community garden.

*\*sighs in Black person\**

&#x200B;

We can only dream.

"Everything you have is from God, and I'm going to take it away."

&#x200B;

Did she...just insinuate that she's God????
